```console
$ useful project --help
Manage Useful Machinery projects

Usage: useful project [COMMAND]

Commands:
  archive    Archive a project
  create     Create a project
  list       List projects
  pool       Manage a project's runner pools
  show       Show a project
  unarchive  Unarchive a project
  update     Change a project's name, repository or branch
  webhook    Manage a project's signed webhooks
  help       Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

```
